  "body": "I am trying to implement [HTMLElement constructor](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#elements-in-the-dom) in Blink. At step 5.2, the part that says &ldquo;and node document set to _document_&rdquo;, I don't know what _document_ refers to.\n\nI think this should follow the behavior of [Image](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-img-element), which says: &ldquo;The element's node document must be the active document of the browsing context of the Window object on which the interface object of the invoked constructor is found.&rdquo;\n\nApologies in advance if I am missing something obvious here.\n",
